md=['# Priority reanalysis — 2026-11-09','','The requested top ten additions are complete: 628,672 source records across all four dates, selected for decision relevance and missing evidence, not favorable returns. All new cells were compared against their frozen source projections. Original master data sheets remain byte-identical. The main workbook holds P02–P10; the complete P01 flow table is in Priority_native_flow.xlsx to keep each file below GitHub’s file limit.','','The existing three research branches were searched. Current reviewed heads: Desktop `3d0b06aa29781d5e39cc3eb45c6d09e174f195a2`, CCode `6152e284fef144c5f614ee26b949136d986fd66f`, Codex `418462afeaf0f14aa8129f6f4d02c3867d772fd0`. Branches share original artifacts; origin means research authorship, not exclusive branch residence. Immutable source URLs and blob hashes are recorded in priority_selection.json. CCode’s new reanalysis was not read.','','The previous shared brief was retained: explicit clocks, counts and denominators; individual and combined evidence; weak/inverse/flat/missing states; price feedback; deterministic rules; future labels excluded from online inputs. This is a priority pass over every newly added row plus the existing workbook coverage/timing cells, not a claim to have newly recomputed every old research layer. Exhaustive reconciliation is deferred at the user’s request.','','## The ten additions','','| Priority | Addition | Rows | Research origin | Why now |','|---|---|---:|---|---|']
